// 2.68: clan raids « Asterion », phase 4 (docs/RAIDS.md): the six other branches of the titan
// (CRÂNE, BRAS GAUCHE, TORSE, ABDOMEN, JAMBE GAUCHE, JAMBE DROITE, generated by
// tools/levelgen/raid_asterion.py), the titan's catalog and its links between branches (an
// objective of one branch opens a passage, switches off lasers, removes reinforcements or stops a
// danger in another): the same in every game of an instance, at the step the relay gives it.

